{"id":"84b8e34b59d68674","group":"56","path":"56/56-ex-negative-conditional-no-fixed-point.md","title":"负条件破坏分层不动点构造","display":"ex-negative-conditional-no-fixed-point — 负条件破坏分层不动点构造","type":"example","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"example","label":"56-ex-negative-conditional-no-fixed-point","aliases":["56-ex-negative-conditional-no-fixed-point"],"display":"ex-negative-conditional-no-fixed-point — 负条件破坏分层不动点构造","depends_on":[],"source_section":"§3.5 Remark 3.5.7","source_printed_pages":"84","source_statement_status":"source-remark-compared; local-two-point-relation-model","source_proof_status":"local-proof-reviewed; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"label","html":"56-ex-negative-conditional-no-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-ex-negative-conditional-no-fixed-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-negative-conditional-no-fixed-point — 负条件破坏分层不动点构造"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§3.5 Remark 3.5.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"84"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-remark-compared; local-two-point-relation-model"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-proof-reviewed; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\">\\(a,b\\)</span> 为两个不同对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\{a,b\\}\">\\(A=\\{a,b\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^2\">\\(A^2\\)</span> 的子集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Psi\">\\(\\Psi\\)</span> 是关系上的算子，其输出仅可能含有有序对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,b)\">\\((a,b)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_n\">\\(X_n\\)</span> 按自然数递归构造。此例将原书负条件的自我否定现象编码在二点关系模型内。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Psi(X)\\coloneqq\\{z\\in\\{(a,b)\\}:z\\notin X\\},\\qquad\nX_0\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad X_{n+1}\\coloneqq\\Psi(X_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Psi(X)\\coloneqq\\{z\\in\\{(a,b)\\}:z\\notin X\\},\\qquad\nX_0\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad X_{n+1}\\coloneqq\\Psi(X_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\\subseteq\\{(a,b)\\}\\land\n\\Psi(\\varnothing)=\\{(a,b)\\}\\land\n\\Psi(\\{(a,b)\\})=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varnothing\\subseteq\\{(a,b)\\}\\land\n\\Psi(\\varnothing)=\\{(a,b)\\}\\land\n\\Psi(\\{(a,b)\\})=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\bigl(\\Psi(\\varnothing)\\subseteq\\Psi(\\{(a,b)\\})\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\bigl(\\Psi(\\varnothing)\\subseteq\\Psi(\\{(a,b)\\})\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(X_{2n}=\\varnothing\\land X_{2n+1}=\\{(a,b)\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(X_{2n}=\\varnothing\\land X_{2n+1}=\\{(a,b)\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall X\\subseteq A^2\\;\\Psi(X)\\ne X,\n\\qquad\n\\Psi\\left(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X_n\\right)\\ne\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall X\\subseteq A^2\\;\\Psi(X)\\ne X,\n\\qquad\n\\Psi\\left(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X_n\\right)\\ne\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>已读原书Remark 3.5.7（印刷第84页）的单规则负条件悖论。这里是本地二点抽象模型，未冒称原书以Ψ命名该算子。固定点方程的(a,b)成员关系将成为“属于X当且仅当不属于X”，故不存在固定点。显式两点比较表明Ψ不单调；递归列在空关系和单边关系间交替，其并也不是固定点。</p>\n<p>这解释了正条件分层构造中的单调性为何有数学负载。例子不声称所有带负条件的系统都无语义；其他负条件语义须另作定义，不能自动沿用正条件的递增并集。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"a,b","display":false},{"tex":"A=\\{a,b\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"A^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\Psi","display":false},{"tex":"(a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"X_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\Psi(X)\\coloneqq\\{z\\in\\{(a,b)\\}:z\\notin X\\},\\qquad\nX_0\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad X_{n+1}\\coloneqq\\Psi(X_n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\varnothing\\subseteq\\{(a,b)\\}\\land\n\\Psi(\\varnothing)=\\{(a,b)\\}\\land\n\\Psi(\\{(a,b)\\})=\\varnothing.","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\bigl(\\Psi(\\varnothing)\\subseteq\\Psi(\\{(a,b)\\})\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;(X_{2n}=\\varnothing\\land X_{2n+1}=\\{(a,b)\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall X\\subseteq A^2\\;\\Psi(X)\\ne X,\n\\qquad\n\\Psi\\left(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X_n\\right)\\ne\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}X_n.","display":true}],"bytes":1977,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-288","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-ex-negative-conditional-no-fixed-point.md]]"}],"outgoing":[]}